@paradigm
slots base 3sg past pp ing
base base
irregular base past pp 3sg ing
rule 3sg s,x,z,ch,sh,o>+es Cy>-1+ies *>+s
rule past e>+d Cy>-1+ied #CVK>++ed *>+ed
rule pp past
rule ing ie>-2+ying ee,ye,oe>+ing e>-1+ing #CVK>++ing *>+ing
# polisillabi con l'accento in fondo: raddoppiano (referred, beginning)
double refer occur prefer admit commit permit omit regret control compel propel transfer deter incur submit expel begin forget upset
# verbi regolari che aprono una locuzione del dizionario (gli irregolari si riconoscono da soli)
verbs look carry figure point sum turn pick check sort work fill try help start need want seem appear resemble
verbs use utilize employ consider factor allow discover learn ascertain determine perform conduct execute handle
verbs address tackle cope note observe highlight investigate examine explore establish create devise develop ensure
verbs postpone delay defer increase decrease decline talk discuss demonstrate assist aid commence kick eliminate
verbs remove attempt endeavor improve enhance grasp comprehend explain clarify spell decide assume conclude act
verbs agree tend indicate suggest own reach resemble

