# ---- connettivi ----
@sense consequence
therefore            +1
thus                 +1
hence                +2
consequently         +1
accordingly          +2
as a result           0
for this reason       0
that is why          -1

@sense addition
moreover             +1
furthermore          +1
in addition           0
additionally          0
what is more          0
besides              -1
on top of that       -1

@sense contrast
however               0
nevertheless         +1
nonetheless          +1
even so              -1
all the same         -1

@sense example
for example           0
for instance          0
by way of example    +2

@sense summary
in short              0
in brief             +1
in summary           +1
to sum up             0
in a nutshell        -1  figurative
all in all           -1

@sense emphasis
in fact               0
indeed               +1
as a matter of fact   0
actually             -1

@sense cause
because of            0
due to                0
owing to             +1
on account of        +1
as a result of        0
thanks to            -1  note:only when the cause is positive

@sense topic
regarding            +1
with regard to       +2
with respect to      +2
as regards           +2
as for                0
when it comes to     -1

@sense nowadays
nowadays             -1
today                 0
currently             0
at present           +1
these days           -1

@sense opening
first of all         -1
first                 0
to begin with         0
firstly               0

@sense evidently
obviously            -1
clearly               0
evidently            +1
plainly               0

@sense nearly
almost                0
nearly                0
virtually            +1
practically          -1

@sense hedge
perhaps               0
maybe                -1
possibly              0
arguably             +1

@sense intensifier
very                  0
extremely            +1
highly               +1
really               -1
incredibly           -1  emphatic
super                -2

@sense quantity
many                  0
numerous             +1
a lot of             -1
lots of              -2
plenty of            -1
a great deal of      +1  note:only with uncountable nouns (a great deal of time)

# articoli delle locuzioni nominali ("a keystone" -> "an essential element")
@article
cls V a e i o u !uni !use !usu !eu !one !ua
def * the
ind * a an:V

# ---- locuzioni nominali (per il resto ci sono le locuzioni del thesaurus) ----
@sense keystone
keystone              0  g:n figurative
cornerstone           0  g:n figurative
linchpin              0  g:n figurative
mainstay              0  g:n
essential element     0  g:n

@sense weak point
weak point            0  g:n
weakness              0  g:n
Achilles' heel        0  g:n figurative
weak spot            -1  g:n

@sense turning point
turning point         0  g:n
milestone             0  g:n figurative
watershed            +1  g:n figurative

@sense point of view
point of view         0  g:n
perspective           0  g:n
viewpoint             0  g:n
standpoint           +1  g:n

# ---- verbi e locuzioni verbali ----
@sense resemblance
look like             0
resemble             +1
bear a resemblance to +2
be similar to         0
take after           -1  note:only between relatives
be the spitting image of -1  figurative
be a dead ringer for -2  figurative

@sense seeming
look like             0
seem                  0
appear               +1
look as if            0

@sense take into account
