shed light on         0  figurative

# ---- giri di parole e ridondanze (in un senso solo) ----
@replace
in order to -> to                                  reason:wordy
due to the fact that -> because | since            reason:wordy
owing to the fact that -> because                  reason:wordy
in view of the fact that -> because | since        reason:wordy
in light of the fact that -> because | given that  reason:wordy
despite the fact that -> although | though         reason:wordy
in spite of the fact that -> although | though     reason:wordy
at this point in time -> now | currently           reason:wordy
at the present time -> now | currently             reason:wordy
at that point in time -> then                      reason:wordy
in the event that -> if                            reason:wordy
in the near future -> soon                         reason:wordy
a large number of -> many                          reason:wordy
the majority of -> most                            reason:wordy
in close proximity to -> near | close to           reason:wordy
with the exception of -> except | except for       reason:wordy
for the purpose of -> for                          reason:wordy
on a daily basis -> daily | every day              reason:wordy
on a regular basis -> regularly                    reason:wordy
in a timely manner -> promptly | on time           reason:wordy
until such time as -> until                        reason:wordy
in excess of -> more than                          reason:wordy
it is important to note that -> note that          reason:wordy
it should be noted that -> note that               reason:wordy
there is no doubt that -> undoubtedly | certainly  reason:wordy
has the ability to -> can                          reason:wordy
make a decision -> decide                          reason:wordy
make an assumption -> assume                       reason:wordy
come to a conclusion -> conclude                   reason:wordy
give consideration to -> consider                  reason:wordy
conduct an investigation into -> investigate       reason:wordy
reach an agreement -> agree                        reason:wordy
have a tendency to -> tend to                      reason:wordy
make an attempt to -> try to | attempt to +1       reason:wordy
be indicative of -> indicate | suggest             reason:wordy
be in possession of -> have | own                  reason:wordy
prior to +1 -> before                              reason:pompous
subsequent to +2 -> after                          reason:pompous
in regard to -> regarding +1 | about               reason:wordy
in regards to -> regarding +1 | about              reason:nonstandard
each and every -> every | each                     reason:redundant
first and foremost -> first                        reason:redundant
end result -> result                               reason:redundant
final outcome -> outcome                           reason:redundant
past history -> history                            reason:redundant
future plans -> plans                              reason:redundant
advance planning -> planning                       reason:redundant
basic fundamentals -> fundamentals | basics        reason:redundant
close proximity -> proximity                       reason:redundant
true fact -> fact                                  reason:redundant
unexpected surprise -> surprise                    reason:redundant
very unique -> unique                              reason:absolute
the reason why is because -> the reason is that    reason:redundant
